---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import OpenSource from '../components/OpenSource.astro';

const personSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Person',
  name: 'Louis Kotze',
  alternateName: 'loukot',
  url: 'https://louiskotze.dev/',
  mainEntityOfPage: 'https://louiskotze.dev/about/',
  jobTitle: 'Senior Full-Stack Engineer',
  description:
    'Senior full-stack engineer and Linux kernel contributor based in Stilbay, South Africa. Lead developer at iOCO Digital on consulting work for enterprise clients, and an upstream contributor to the Linux kernel, wpa_supplicant, NetworkManager, and the wireless regulatory database.',
  email: 'mailto:louis@louiskotze.dev',
  address: {
    '@type': 'PostalAddress',
    addressLocality: 'Stilbay',
    addressRegion: 'Western Cape',
    addressCountry: 'ZA',
  },
  worksFor: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'iOCO Digital',
    url: 'https://iocodigital.com/',
  },
  alumniOf: [
    { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'BMW IT Hub South Africa' },
    { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Discovery Limited' },
    { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Hello Group' },
    { '@type': 'CollegeOrUniversity', name: 'Varsity College' },
  ],
  knowsAbout: [
    'Linux kernel development',
    'wireless networking',
    'Angular',
    'TypeScript',
    'Java',
    'Kafka',
    'Kubernetes',
    'distributed systems',
    'engineering leadership',
    'Agile delivery',
    'mentorship',
  ],
  sameAs: [
    'https://github.com/louis-kotze',
    'https://linkedin.com/in/louis-kotze',
    'https://lore.kernel.org/all/?q=f:loukot@gmail.com',
  ],
};
---
<Base
  title="About | Louis Kotze"
  description="Senior full-stack engineer and Linux kernel contributor, based in South Africa. Ten-plus years across FinTech, automotive, and pharmaceuticals."
  ogType="profile"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(personSchema)} slot="head" />

  <h1>About</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    Senior full-stack engineer and Linux kernel contributor, based in Stilbay
    on the southern coast of South Africa. Ten-plus years across FinTech,
    automotive, and pharmaceuticals. Currently delivering enterprise
    platform engagements through
    <a href="https://iocodigital.com">iOCO Digital</a>. Upstream
    contributor to the Linux kernel, wpa_supplicant, NetworkManager, and
    the wireless regulatory database.
  </p>

  <h2>How I work</h2>
  <p>
    I started with Agile/Scrum a decade ago and ended up internalising the
    principles more than the ceremonies: transparency, regular reflection,
    iteration over perfection. That frame has travelled everywhere since,
    into engineering management, upstream contribution, even my personal
    productivity. Most of what I write here is about applying that
    discipline in new contexts, including with AI as a working partner.
  </p>
  <p>
    The <a href="/blog/">writing</a> is where the detail lives.
  </p>

  <OpenSource />

  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Professional &amp; general:</strong>
      <a href="mailto:louis@louiskotze.dev">louis@louiskotze.dev</a></li>
    <li><strong>Kernel &amp; upstream work:</strong>
      <a href="mailto:loukot@gmail.com">loukot@gmail.com</a> (the address my
      kernel patches are attributed to on
      <a href="https://lore.kernel.org/all/?q=f:loukot@gmail.com">lore.kernel.org</a>).
    </li>
    <li><strong>GitHub:</strong>
      <a href="https://github.com/louis-kotze">github.com/louis-kotze</a></li>
    <li><strong>LinkedIn:</strong>
      <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/louis-kotze">linkedin.com/in/louis-kotze</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="verify">Verify my commits</h2>
  <p>
    Every commit I push from my primary machine is signed with an SSH
    (ed25519) key. GitHub shows a <strong>Verified</strong> badge on the
    commit when the key below is on my account.
  </p>

  <h3>Public key</h3>
  <pre><code>ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIOKAYsuKIn3ngx+0CpvawsAZVLR7dY4pHA8BPAkzRM5d loukot@gmail.com</code></pre>

  <h3>Fingerprint</h3>
  <pre><code>SHA256:AlxMiAoC8XMhauBqgjZr3tN8VKo9neq8DJIPwxH1whM</code></pre>

  <p class="muted">
    To verify a commit locally: add the public key above to your
    <code>allowed_signers</code> file, point <code>git</code> at it with
    <code>git config gpg.ssh.allowedSignersFile &lt;path&gt;</code>, then
    run <code>git log --show-signature</code> on a commit from this
    repository.
  </p>

  <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
  <p>
    I run <a href="https://prolificstudio.co.za">Prolific Studio</a> as a
    small consultancy. If my open-source work has been useful to you,
    consider
    <a href="https://ko-fi.com/prolificstudio">supporting it via Ko-fi</a>
    or <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/prolificdev">Buy Me a Coffee</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Colophon</h2>
  <p>
    This site is built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a> and
    hosted on <a href="https://pages.cloudflare.com">Cloudflare Pages</a>.
    The source is public at
    <a href="https://github.com/louis-kotze/louiskotze.dev">github.com/louis-kotze/louiskotze.dev</a>.
    MIT on code, CC BY 4.0 on content. No analytics, no cookies, no
    trackers.
  </p>
</Base>
